  "description_short": "Artisan coffee roastery and wholesome bakery tucked away in Wilderness, serving freshly roasted beans and homemade treats.",
  "description_long": "The Green Shed Coffee Roastery is a hidden gem on Leila's Lane, where the aroma of freshly roasted coffee beans greets you before you even step inside. This working roastery and café takes its coffee seriously, sourcing quality beans and roasting them on-site, while the bakery counter tempts with wholesome breads, pastries, and cakes baked fresh daily.\n\nThe relaxed atmosphere makes it equally suited for a quick morning flat white or a leisurely breakfast with friends. Beyond the café, you'll find shelves stocked with their house-roasted beans, local products, and artisan groceries — it's part café, part deli, part community gathering spot. The space feels unpretentious and welcoming, with wooden tables and plenty of natural light.\n\nLocated just off the main road through Wilderness, it's become a favourite stop for locals and visitors exploring the Garden Route. Whether you're after a proper espresso, a slice of homemade cake, or bags of beans to take home, The Green Shed delivers quality without fuss.",
